<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB</p>
<p>reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of</p>
<p>Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Feb 20-26:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 52.00</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 55.38</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 56.94</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 59.80</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$144.45</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$108.34</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 76.76</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 19.15</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  1.92</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 21.23</p>
</text>
